@pkozlowski-opensource @vicb a PR is ready https://github.com/angular/angular/pull/5762

I considered changing the angular preset upstream, in the conventional-changelog repo. Not sure if this problem is general enough that others would want it though.

@ajoslin do you think it'd be worth adding logic to the angular preset in conventional-changelog that would include any commit that contains a `BREAKING CHANGE` note, regardless of its type?
